    {
        "text": "Ahem. Citizens of Zeruertza, I am your environment and climate representative, Edge Eartheart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are here today to discuss the future of Zeruertza.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "The survey results are back, and the representatives have discussed a few possible solutions. We will make our choice from these options today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We also hope to come up with an answer for how the city will move forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, today's meeting will be officiated by Avdotya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "30_g6_reception",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure about this, Avdotya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, you've lived in Zeruertza for quite a while, and the people in town know you. But this is the first time you'll be standing before everyone, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, you're up, Avdotya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might take some time, Master Edge. Is that okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, you won't break my record of putting half the city to sleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never heard that story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I remember. Master Eartheart went into a long discourse about geology.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "He went on and on until the sun went down, and only stopped when he wore himself out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I probably won't go THAT long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go, Avdotya. This is the culmination of the time you spent here as our resident surface-born.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you. Here goes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Avdotya!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice from Far Away"
    },
    {
        "text": "Avdotya! I'm with you, no matter what you say!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice from Far Away"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't my speeches get the same reception?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not just your record-breaking speech. All the other meetings you officiate last for ages.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're always the first to fall asleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not today. Avdotya looks different this time. What does she have on her mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
