        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fantastic. I respect Master Edge's knowledge, but his meetings are torturous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Avdotya's voice is as beautiful as she is. I could listen to her all day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Relaxed Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Greetings, citizens of Zeruertza. I am Avdotya, literature representative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Today, I officiate over this meeting that will determine Zeruertza's future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have discussed with Master Edge and believe that there are three practical plans to carry out Zeruertza's evacuation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before discussing the plans, however, there's something else that I want to talk about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's about my past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not the past of Avdotya Razorpen, but the past of Avdotya Nikolayevna Ivanova.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I first came to live among the Durins, I created many stories, and shared mine with many people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This, however, I've never told anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to share it with you today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was born to a noble family in Ursus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "30_i07",
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.1,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.1,
        "xScaleTo": 0.9,
        "yScaleTo": 0.9,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": 0,
        "duration": 30,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Avdotya thought she would struggle to find words."
    },
    {
        "text": "But she found her memories pouring out as soon as she opened her mouth."
    },
    {
        "text": "It was not that she did not know what to say; it was that she had too much to say and did not know where to start."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Durins do not know what it means for her. But she does."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the first time she's looked back on her past since coming to the Durins."
    },
    {
        "text": "She thought time would let the past fade, let her forget that she was once a woman of Ursus."
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, though, she realizes that the past never truly goes away."
    },
    {
        "text": "But meeting Gavial and the people she brought with her helps her realize\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is not so bad."
    },
    {
        "text": "The past pulls her down bit by bit, along with the Durins listening to her story."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But she no longer feels pain from it, and thus neither do the Durins."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
