    },
    {
        "text": "Stitch sits in his room, trying not to think about it."
    },
    {
        "text": "But he can't help it."
    },
    {
        "text": "He knows this is his last chance."
    },
    {
        "text": "Let it go, and he will never surpass his teacher."
    },
    {
        "text": "And he has a feeling that if he does not win this time, he will always be second-best, though to what he cannot describe."
    },
    {
        "text": "He knows."
    },
    {
        "text": "But he can't do it."
    },
    {
        "text": "He puts his arms around his head."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Knock knock."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is someone knocking on his door."
    },
    {
        "text": "Stitch, you're here, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're in there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave me alone, Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talk to Catch if this is about the dome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "No can do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because this is your job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Open the door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not coming in here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
