    },
    {
        "text": "The door and the walls around it collapse with a bang, and Gavial walks in casually holding her great axe."
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "She sees Stich sitting by the desk with his arms around his head, his expression hidden."
    },
    {
        "text": "A few blank pieces of paper lie by his hand."
    },
    {
        "text": "A few more pieces of paper lie by his feet, either torn to pieces or crumpled up."
    },
    {
        "text": "Design sketches for the dome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanted to do it, didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't you give me a break, Gavial?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not so much that I'm not giving you a break...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at you, shutting yourself in this room staring at sketches, holding in everything you're thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who's not giving yourself a break, Stitch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
