        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "30_g8_malistroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$newhope01_intro",
        "key": "$newhope01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you so against repairing the dome?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because of the job my teacher left me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Teacher? Job? Didn't Catch say your teacher went missing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't... a sudden disappearance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Though he didn't tell anyone else, he did leave me an assignment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to win everyone over with my dome design, and make the dome of Zeruertza my own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only then will he come back to find me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, he'll never come back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your last name is Canvas too. Are you related?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I changed it later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eight years ago, I survived an Originium vein explosion. I had no home to return to, but my teacher took me in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So your Oripathy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, that was when I caught it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "On the surface, people with this disease are called the Infected and cast out from society.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not the case among the Durins, but we can't fully cure it, only keep its symptoms in check.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the same up there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So I changed my name to that of my mentor and studied architecture under him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear he was pretty famous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course! Finch Canvas was the design representative of Zeruertza.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Surface-dwellers would call our style 'minimalist'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "We oppose elaborate and flashy designs, seeing them as the unchecked spread of desire, the product of a slothful life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this rate, we will inevitably be swallowed up by our own desire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why we advocate a lifestyle that emphasizes the true nature of things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "True nature?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How things are in their most natural state. We oppose all unnecessary functions, trying to keep things the way they are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is our rebellion against a life of desire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Like the simple design of your room?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, my style is not exactly the same as that of my teacher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My style came from his, but in some ways, we go in opposite directions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allowing the city to welcome destruction while looking its best is a luxury that comes only from our excess productivity. It is arrogant and wasteful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "One's time is limited, and my clock is ticking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're Infected too, Gavial. Don't you understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "You only have so much time left. You need to spend your efforts on something more meaningful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. That's why I study medicine, so I can heal myself and people like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But if that's how you feel, why not seize this last chance?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I don't want to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you see the sketches here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are proof of my failure over the years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "I made proposal after proposal, only to see all of them rejected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "After that, I couldn't even come up with a passable sketch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know who is the problem: the Zeruertzans, or me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I know is that the mere sight of the dome fills me with fear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's like a cage that my teacher has locked me in, trapping me forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if it's my last chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't do it anymore!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if I came up with a new plan, there's no hope of it getting through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "And you tell me how I'm going to come up with a new plan that can pass review in such a short time?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
